config RUST_SYSVIPC_MSG
	bool "Rust System V message queues"
	depends on RUST && SYSVIPC
	help
	  Build ipc/msg.o from its Rust translation. Queue creation, message
	  transfer, msgctl, namespace lifecycle, compatibility ABI conversion
	  and proc reporting are owned by Rust. Only kernel macro, static-inline
	  and syscall declaration boundaries use the dedicated C helper object.
	  The original C provider is retained when this option is disabled.
